    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44095" root="&#xA;                        نفى&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُفَايَةٌ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>Refuse;</i> i. e. <i>what one rejects,</i> of a thing,
<i>because of its badness:</i> (S:) or <i>refuse little in
quantity:</i> (T:) or the <i>remains, and bad portion,</i>
                        
of a thing: (M, K:) or, accord. to IAar, <i>what
is bad of wheat</i> or <i>food.</i> (M.)

